rooms_desc ({"The living-room of The Salesman's house.A particular chair attracts your attention.You think it looks as ifit has been made out of the rib cage of a stegosaurus.>The Salesman enters.He bops you on the shoulder and says :\" This chair you're looking atwas made out of the rib cage of a stegosaurus.The Salesman leaves to the church.","This is The Salesman's jail.See it as a Horror Hotel:You Check In But You Don't Check Out ! Enjoy your stay.","A sign says: Take Too Much And Thy Wilt Be Expelled !A smaller sign says : Beware of the leopard.","This room is The Salesman's meditation room.It is a bit dark in here.Many soft pillows lie on the ground.","The Salesman's bedroom.Since You are here, you may call Him Olaf.Most of the available space is occupied by a soft foam matress, silk sheetscovers it.An ashtray with a familiar sensimillia-smell rests on the leftof the bed, a bottle of Dom Perignon '68 -Olaf's year of birth, a very goodyear- is noticed on the left.$ure looks inviting to you..... And wait till you see the contents of thatlarge drawer under the bed :)",0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"The Salesman's so-called 'house'.Look at it, will you ?","The Salesman's Jail","The Salesman's storage room.","Meditation Room","The Salesman's Bedroom.",0,0,0,0,0,})
